# Vendored Claude Design handoff bundles.
#
# `docs/design/*-spec/source/**` holds the frozen, read-only design
# prototypes (HTML/CSS/JSX) exported from claude.ai/design. They are a
# reference, not maintained source — see `docs/design/*-spec/README.md`.
# Marking them vendored + generated keeps them out of language stats,
# collapses them in diffs, and excludes them from code scanning
# (CodeQL default setup / GitHub Code Quality honor `linguist-generated`),
# so the prototypes' own lint quirks aren't reported against this repo.
docs/design/*-spec/source/** linguist-vendored=true linguist-generated=true
